  "nonlinear_category_reason": "Every strand keeps its own forward order and nothing is ever shown out of turn in time; the inversions are only between strands running at the same moment, which the telling cuts between sideways. Five guests pass through one hotel over two days, and the film moves between their rooms rather than between times.",
  "syuzhet_notes": "The telling moves from room to room across two days in one building, so consecutive told bullets belong to different guests rather than to different times.",
  "fabula_notes": "The two days run continuously. Where two guests are doing things in the same hour, either ranking would serve.",
